g shapes like tombs and dragon's eggs and they even have shiny little king cake chocolates, that are just adorable. I decided to get a couple of the cute little king cakes and I couldn't wait- I snarfed one down in the car. This particular chocolate had a gooey filling and I felt quite fancy eating a gourmet chocolate on..."},{"business_id":"vZdO4-c9vZQr0U9QX3Kr5A","review_id":"C20_dQttGlobRkd-O-9hNw","date":"2019-03-15T21:37:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9357635974884033,"text_excerpt":"Their chocolate is amazing! Perfect confections! Service is great. Cannot recommend this place enough. I don't even have a favorite because they're all delicious, though I have to say the ones with rum are my go-to."},{"business_id":"vZdO4-c9vZQr0U9QX3Kr5A","review_id":"LLQ0kKYKeJb9zKUP98dS6Q","date":"2018-12-21T05:58:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9316519498825073,"text_excerpt":"Decadent chocolatier. Tucked next to a cidery and distillery is a cozy artisan chocolate boutique. Don't miss it! The chocolates are sculpted into delicious masterpieces. The decadent bon bons are infused with spices and liquor from the neighboring distillery and cidery. Of the dozen or so eclectic flavors, the Malted Apple Cider Caramel was hands down my favorite with an impeccable blend of apple cider and caramel, followed by the Earl Grey and Pink Peppercorn bon bon. The fiery Habanero bon bon sizzled my taste buds, my mouth was on fire! The other flavors were a bit more subtle: Blueberry Goat Cheese, Sazerac, Hemingway Daiqiuri, Brown Butter Bourbon. I highly recommend eating the bon ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vZdO4-c9vZQr0U9QX3Kr5A","photo_id":"_wrSeP3UtkxLCPsCLtqqjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_wrSeP3UtkxLCPsCLtqqjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
